ext2 bytes: end accepted, past and crossing refused
ext2 bitmap: block+inode counts ok
ext2 owners: block+inode owners ok
ext2 write rollback: two blocks released
ext2 create: create+lookup+unlink ok
ext2 nested: create+lookup+unlink in /etc ok
ext2 write indirect: rollback+grow+zero+restore ok
ext2 io failure: every phase rolled back or committed, fence+recover ok
ext2 full: block+inode NoSpace for mkdir+create, rolled back, control ok
ext2 exhaustion: indirect NoSpace rollback, EL0 fillers ready
